2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - TypeScript orchestrator for workflow management (Node.js ES modules)
   - Git branch lifecycle management for feature branches in management repos
   - YAML-based task state machine (status.yaml, task T8.yaml)
   - Feature branch pattern: `feature/{featureId}` as the parent branch for all task branches
   - Task branch pattern: `feature/{featureId}-{taskId}` merging into the feature branch
   - status.yaml fields: `feature_branch`, `feature_branch_base_sha`, `handoff_pr_url`, `drift_detected`
   - Vitest for unit testing with real git repos (file:// protocol)
   - SSH key auth for git operations (`/home/agent/.ssh/agent_id_rsa`)
   - Path: `/agent/data/agent-workflow` = implementation repo (`workflow`); `/agent/data/project-workspace` = management repo

3. Files and Code Sections:

   - **`/agent/data/project-workspace/docs/features/autonomous-task-orchestrator/tasks/T8.yaml`**
     - Management repo task YAML for T8
